WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.182
Today we will select colours intentionally. Our work connects with communities across

00:00:05.182 --> 00:00:05.597
Africa.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:09.245
Choose three colours that suit your chosen message.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.946
Test the colours in small labelled boxes.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:20.125
Circle the most readable combination and plan where to use it. Explain one respectful

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:22.962
similarity or difference with another African example.
